the u.s and receives the drugs that come via&nbsp;
this ultralight airplane into the u.s but in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:57.520
the short it was kind of how he got to the us&nbsp;
he was the guy flying the plane in that case&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:04.800
but kind of has to take over he has to basically&nbsp;
kill the guy and replace him and take over and be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:09.840
the permanent guy and leave his family behind&nbsp;
and and be that guy in in the us now and so&nbsp;&nbsp;

